  path="/credentials.html"
  ogType="profile"
  image="/images/chad-keith.jpg"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="page-hero">
    <h1>Credentials</h1>
    <p>Computer engineering from UNC Charlotte, then Jamf and Apple certifications — the same stack Atlas lists at <a href="https://www.atlascarolina.com/certifications" target="_blank" rel="noopener">atlascarolina.com/certifications</a>, plus Credly, MasterClass, and OpenAI Academy badges.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-banner">
    <p>New practice: <a href="https://atlassolutions.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Atlas AI</a> — AI integrations, agentic workflows, training, and security for Carolinas businesses, backed by Atlas Technology Solutions.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Education</div>
    <h2>University of North Carolina at Charlotte</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">BS in Computer Engineering, December 2006.</p>
    <div class="cert-grid">
      <div class="cert-card">
        <span class="cert-icon">🎓</span>
        <div>
          <h3>BS, Computer Engineering</h3>
          <p>Focus in analog and digital communications · December 2006</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-card">
        <span class="cert-icon">📖</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Minor, Religious Studies</h3>
          <p>University of North Carolina at Charlotte</p>
