      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Jamf</div>
    <h2>Jamf Certifications</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Current Credly badges and partner-track credentials for Apple device management and security.</p>
    <div class="cert-grid">
      <div class="cert-card">
        <span class="cert-icon">🔧</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Jamf Management Engineer</h3>
          <p>Configure Jamf Pro instances and build core workflows for customers.</p>
